---
import Container from "../ui/Container.astro";
---

<section class="home-positioning">
  <Container>
    <div class="home-positioning__label">
      <span>LKProfessionals</span>
      <span>Business-first technology</span>
    </div>

    <div class="home-positioning__statement">
      <h2>
        We don't start
        <em>with the technology.</em>
        We start with what
        the business needs to do.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="home-positioning__detail">
      <p class="home-positioning__lead">
        Since 2013, LKProfessionals has worked from
        one practical principle: understand the
        operation before deciding what should be built.
      </p>

      <div>
        <p>
          Our work spans engineering, infrastructure,
          automation, design and digital growth. That
          breadth means connected problems can be
          treated as one operating challenge instead
          of being handed between unrelated vendors.
        </p>

        <p>
          Technical ownership remains visible after
          launch. Access, maintainability, future
          changes and long-term operating cost are
          part of delivery from the beginning.
        </p>

        <a href="/about/">
          More about LKP
          <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>

<style>
  .home-positioning {
    background: #fff;

    padding-block:
      clamp(7rem, 14vw, 13rem);
  }

  .home-positioning__label {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;

    gap: 2rem;

    border-top:
      1px solid #d9dde3;

    padding-top: 1rem;

    color: #677486;

    font-size: 0.62rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .home-positioning__statement {
    margin-block:
      clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }

  .home-positioning__statement h2 {
    max-width: 14ch;

    margin: 0;

    color: #0d1b2d;

    font-family: var(--font-serif);

    font-size:
      clamp(3.3rem, 7.6vw, 7.6rem);

    font-weight: 400;

    letter-spacing: -0.066em;

    line-height: 0.91;
  }

  .home-positioning__statement em {
    display: block;

    color: #3d5fc6;

    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .home-positioning__detail {
    display: grid;

    grid-template-columns:
      minmax(0, 0.72fr)
      minmax(18rem, 0.5fr);

    gap: clamp(4rem, 13vw, 13rem);

    align-items: start;

    margin-left:
      clamp(0rem, 14vw, 14rem);
  }

  .home-positioning__detail p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .home-positioning__lead {
    color: #1c2b3d;

    font-size:
      clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.55rem);

    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .home-positioning__detail > div {
    display: grid;

    gap: 1.3rem;

    color: #6b7787;

    font-size: 0.85rem;

    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .home-positioning__detail a {
    width: fit-content;

    display: inline-flex;

    gap: 0.6rem;

    margin-top: 1rem;

    border-bottom:
      1px solid #0d1b2d;

    padding-bottom: 0.25rem;

    color: #0d1b2d;

    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 750;
  }

  @media (max-width: 52rem) {
    .home-positioning__detail {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;

      margin-left: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
